PhoneBox 0.6.9 — panel: unchanged leaves are not written to the DOM.
Why: every number, gauge ring (SVG re-inserted), chart title and memory bar was rewritten every second even when unchanged
(82.9 % of DOM writes were no-ops).
- setText / setKids / setVar: write only when the displayed text, child key or CSS variable actually changes.
- Applied to stat, gauge, chart title/value, meters, media, clock, onair.
Measured: identical state twice -> DOM mutations on the visible page 25 -> 0 (2 when only CPU changes).

